  </p>
  
  <ul>
    <li>
      The lawsuit further states:
    </li>
  </ul>
  
  <blockquote>
    <p>
      As the truth about the company’s need to raise cash and its platform’s limitations reached the market, the value of Coinbase’s shares declined dramatically.
    </p>
  </blockquote>
  
